Personally I got to like Magicbane a lot; as a valkyrie you may get
expert as well. But being already expert in long sword is also very
promising at the moment. You should take into account what alignment
you are, and what artifact weapons you want to aim at. The first one
that you will get will be of another weapon class, though. In sabre
you can get only to basic; sabres are not bad if you eventually reach
Gehennom with all those demons (and also shades), but currently no.

To summarize, I'd go for a Mjollnir/Magicbane combination and consider
also one of the artifact longswords (Frostbrand, e.g.), if it happens
to be offered to you.

